configured (`keys = 'filo_vehiclekeys'`,\ntheir own prompts, target option and keybinds off). Ensure them **after** `filo_vehiclekeys`:"},"452":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility-11","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility#tr_minigames","content":"In this mode, difficulty, class tiers, alarms and lockpick/hotwire alerts come from tr\\_minigames'\nown config. `Config.Blacklist` is still checked before a hotwire starts, but copy the models into\ntr\\_minigames' `excludeModels` too. Keep `Config.TrMinigames.HotwireItem` equal to tr\\_minigames'\n`Config.hotwire.item` (default `wire_strippers`)."},"453":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility-12","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility#editing-the-bridge","content":"Everything that depends on another resource lives in `bridge/` and stays open when escrowed."},"454":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility-13","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility#editing-the-bridge","content":"File"},"455":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility-14","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility#editing-the-bridge","content":"What it contains"},"456":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility-15","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility#editing-the-bridge","content":"`bridge/framework/client.lua` / `server.lua`"},"457":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/compatibility-16","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehicl