/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/configuration#dispatch","content":"**custom** runs `Custom(data)` on the offender's client, so you can call any dispatch export."},"540":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","type":"page","content":"Exports","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Paid Resources","🔑 filo_vehiclekeys"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports"},"541":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports-0","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","content":"Client and server exports provided by filo_vehiclekeys for use in other resources."},"542":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports-1","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports#server","content":"Server"},"543":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports-2","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports#client","content":"Client"},"544":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports-3","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports#server","content":"`target` can be a plate, network ID or entity."},"545":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports-4","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/exports#client","content":"`StartEngineWithoutKeys` is also exported for tr\\_core's key bridge. You don't need to call it yourself."},"546":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","type":"page","content":"Flows","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Paid Resources","🔑 filo_vehiclekeys"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows"},"547":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-0","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","content":"Theft, carjacking, police, locksmith, admin panel and how keys are validated."},"548":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-1","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"Lockpicking & Hotwiring"},"549":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-2","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"Carjacking"},"550":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-3","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#police","content":"Police"},"551":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-4","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"Locksmith"},"552":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-5","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"Admin Panel"},"553":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-6","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#key-validation","content":"Key Validation"},"554":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-7","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"Every attempt resolves to a difficulty tier (`easy` / `medium` / `hard` / `expert`) from\n`ModelDifficulty`, then `VehicleClassDifficulty`, then `DefaultDifficulty`."},"555":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-8","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"**Lockpick:** use `lockpick` or `advanced_lockpick` near a locked vehicle. Pass the minigame, then the server rolls the tier's chance. Tools lose durability and may trigger the alarm."},"556":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-9","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"**Hotwire:** press `H` in a vehicle you have no key for, with `Config.Hotwire.HotwireItem`. A progress bar runs for the tier's time, then the minigame at the tier's level, then the server rolls the chance."},"557":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-10","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"**Search:** press `Y` in a parked vehicle to search for its key (`Config.KeySearching`)."},"558":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-11","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"Models in `Config.Blacklist.Models` can't be lockpicked, hotwired or carjacked (per action)."},"559":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-12","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"With `Config.Minigames = 'tr_minigames'`, tr\\_minigames handles these flows. See\nCompatibility."},"560":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-13","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"Aim a gun at an NPC driver within `Distance` of a car slower than `MaxSpeed`. The driver brakes and\na progress bar starts; it cancels if you stop aiming or move away."},"561":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-14","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"**Success:** the driver gets out and runs, the car unlocks, you get its key and police are alerted."},"562":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-15","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"**Failure:** the driver drives off or fights back (`FailBehavior`)."},"563":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-16","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"The aim check only runs while a weapon is drawn. Each player has a `Cooldown` between attempts."},"564":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-17","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#police","content":"Jobs in `Config.PoliceBypass.Jobs` (at the minimum grade, on duty, and carrying `police_bypass` if\nset) can lock, unlock, insert the ignition and start the engine on any vehicle. With\n`UseItemToUnlock`, using the item unlocks the closest vehicle. Carjacking a blacklisted vehicle\nwith the bypass is allowed and sends no dispatch."},"565":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-18","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#police","content":"Successful lockpicks, hotwires and carjacks send a dispatch alert based on `Config.Dispatch.Chance`."},"566":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-19","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**Key cutting:** at a key cutting station or with the `key_cutting_tool`. Copies a key from the locksmith's inventory or a nearby vehicle. Uses a `blank_key`."},"567":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-20","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**OBD programming:** for keyless vehicles. The locksmith sits in the driver's seat and uses the `locksmith_tablet`."},"568":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-21","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**Invalidate old keys:** optional when making a key. Generates a new key ID so every old copy stops working."},"569":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-22","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**NPC store:** when `OfflineStore.MininumDuty` or fewer locksmiths are on duty, players can buy spare keys for vehicles they own. Prices are enforced on the server."},"570":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-23","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**Ignition repair:** use `electrical_tools` in a hotwired vehicle to clear the hotwire. Only needed when `Config.Hotwire.SaveHotwireState` is on."},"571":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-24","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"`/keyadmin` lists stored and spawned vehicles (spawned ones have a green dot). For each vehicle you can:"},"572":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-25","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"toggle keyless, keys-in-ignition, engine-on and hotwired"},"573":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-26","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"add or remove jobs with access"},"574":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-27","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"regenerate the key ID, making every existing key useless"},"575":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-28","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"give a key to an online player"},"576":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-29","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"delete the stored record"},"577":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-30","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"Every action is checked on the server against the `command.keyadmin` permission."},"578":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-31","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#key-validation","content":"A key item is valid when its plate and key ID match the vehicle's current key ID. The server keeps\nthat ID on the spawned vehicle, or in the `filo_vehiclekeys` table for owned vehicles that aren't\nspawned. Checks never trust client data."},"579":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-32","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#key-validation","content":"Keys for unowned vehicles (NPC, stolen or job cars) are removed when the vehicle is deleted and\nafter a server restart (`Config.KeyCleanup`). Player-owned vehicles always keep their keys."},"580":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","type":"page","content":"🔑 filo_vehiclekeys","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Paid Resources","🔑 filo_vehiclekeys"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys"},"581":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-0","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","content":"Item-based vehicle keys, theft, police and locksmith system for FiveM."},"582":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-1","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Features"},"583":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-2","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#pages","content":"Pages"},"584":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-3","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","content":"Item-based vehicle keys for FiveM: physical keys and key fobs, ignition handling, lockpicking,\nhotwiring, NPC carjacking, a locksmith job, police dispatch and an admin panel. All outcomes are\ndecided on the ser